E AX3137 1490-uppercase-pattern-binder.ax:10:6-13 uppercase-pattern-binder "pattern binder `Nothing` starts with a capital letter" #"`Nothing` binds every value here" !"a bare name in pattern position binds every value, whatever its case, so this arm matches everything and the arms after it are dead; a constructor test needs the parentheses" ?"rename the binder in lowercase to bind, or write `(Name)` or `(Name ...)` to test a constructor"
